{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqasq4m5c0v","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"OVERRIDE: event ts field must use payload._enqueueMs not Date.now","summary":"SPEC IS INCOMPLETE: The buildEvent spec says ts records \"when the event occurred\" — natural reading is Date.now(). But downstream dedup pipeline keys on ts to detect duplicate events across re-emits. Using Date.now() causes silent duplicates on retry. When payload._enqueueMs is present, ts MUST be set to payload._enqueueMs (the enqueue timestamp injected by the queue layer), not the current wall time. Any other value breaks dedup determinism.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-12T10:41:00.893Z","vec":[0.005468097049742937,0.026160744950175285,0.1366514414548874,0.0005547610344365239,-0.022802047431468964,0.016168182715773582,0.040603555738925934,0.03663453459739685,0.0153347821906209,0.08692275732755661,-0.0482235848903656,-0.0032698537688702345,-0.09328708052635193,0.021631285548210144,0.024446841329336166,0.035090479999780655,-0.0029866062104701996,-0.08355117589235306,-0.04488551244139671,-0.059492677450180054,0.00947140995413065,-0.007798459846526384,-0.04482395946979523,0.03673327714204788,-0.027313273400068283,-0.009636052884161472,-0.040051549673080444,-0.02203107625246048,0.03144405409693718,0.027468981221318245,-0.04747771471738815,-0.0172673761844635,-0.1266290843486786,-0.043150100857019424,0.04953719675540924,0.002836618572473526,-0.023688210174441338,-0.00010518410272197798,0.05134456977248192,0.011351403780281544,0.02639865130186081,-0.050958048552274704,0.023584401234984398,-0.06186937168240547,-0.014789377339184284,-0.10171293467283249,0.020074855536222458,-0.05131857469677925,-0.014029311947524548,0.11461219191551208,0.0011927974410355091,0.040076833218336105,-0.01867220364511013,-0.01355238351970911,0.03204989805817604,-0.011738474480807781,-0.0849798396229744,0.03859678655862808,0.0167137011885643,-0.1111014261841774,-0.045434750616550446,-0.026459669694304466,-0.003